the global memory shortage and said, "From, a global allocation perspective.

118
00:11:18,672 --> 00:11:30,432
实际上，让每个人都在自己的电脑里占有一大堆全球有限供应的 DRAM，
而可能只在 5% 的时间里被使用，这确实挺糟糕的。
actually, it's quite terrible to have everyone have a bunch of worlds' limited
supply of DRAM sitting in their own computer and being used maybe 5% of the time.

119
00:11:30,752 --> 00:11:31,552
噢，扎心了。
Oh, bite.

120
00:11:31,552 --> 00:11:31,712
我。
me.

121
