125
00:11:55,662 --> 00:12:04,964
随后 Altman 表示他的话被断章取义了，他其实是希望全世界都有大量的内存，
甚至他还在 X 上把名字短暂改成了 Ram Altman。
Altman then said his words were taken out of context and that he actually wants the world
to have tons of memory and that he even briefly changed his name on X to Ram Altman.

126
00:12:05,392 --> 00:12:07,632
搞得好像这就能洗白他似的。
As if that absolves him somehow.

127
00:12:07,792 --> 00:12:09,632
