RAM 应该存在于我们的电脑里，而我们现在经历的短缺对普通人
来说比对 AI 来说是更大的问题，解决这个问题应该是优先事项。
Ram should be present in our computers, and this shortage that we are experiencing is a greater problem for the regular people than it
will ever be for AI, and resolving it should be a priority.

135
00:12:47,152 --> 00:12:55,152
但其中确实包含了一个关于稀缺资源的观点，而大家的反应把它变成了一个比原本大得多的问题。
But there is an actual point buried in it about scarce resources, and
the reaction turned it into something much bigger than what it was.

136
00:12:55,312 --> 00:12:57,444
看看他这一周更宏观的状况。
And look at the bigger picture of his week.

