He's publishing the uncomfortable numbers, admitting OpenAI doesn't know how to safely reach full RSI,
and posting on X that people should always be in control of the future.

138
00:13:07,152 --> 00:13:09,312
这不像是一个在藏私心的人。
That's not someone hiding the ball.

139
00:13:09,792 --> 00:13:12,112
而且这不仅仅是 OpenAI 的事。
And this isn't only an open AI thing.

140
